      ":question/problem": "Consider the following boundary value problem (BVP).\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}-2{y}^{\u2032}+y=4,\\,{y}^{\u2032}(-1)=0,\\,{y}^{\u2032}(0)=1,\\,-1\\le x\\le 0\n$$\n\nThe solution is given by\n\n$$\ny=(A+Bx){e}^{x}+g(x).\n$$\n\nFind the constants $A$ and $B,$ and the function $g(x).$\n\n$\\,A=$ {{field-1}} \n$\\,B=$ \n{{field-2}} $\\,g(x)=$ {{field-3}}"
